From 385a5ad4f966b3b0d07957e5029182d9063ae562 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The browser Authors <noreply@browser.invalid>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 17:13:39 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 28/55] dismiss-permission-prompts

--dismiss-permission-prompts: permission prompts, File System Access
prompts included, are built unseen and dismissed after a short random
delay, and Input.permissionPromptDismissed tells the client. The event's
declaration rides in input-actions (Input.pdl, input_handler.*).
---
